bind Submit Request: Request ID, Employee Name, Request Type
bind Review Request: Manager ID, Decision
bind Setup Remote Access: Access Status
bind Monitor Performance: Performance Rating
bind Update Payroll: Payroll Status
bind Complete Survey: Survey Score
bind Send Notification: Notification Status
bind Notify Employee: Notification Status
bind Revoke Access: Access Status
Request ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Employee Name: John Doe, Jane Smith, Alice Johnson
Request Type: Remote Work, Flexible Hours
Manager ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Decision: Approved, Rejected
Access Status: Setup, Revoked
Payroll Status: Updated, Pending
Notification Status: Sent, Pending
Performance Rating: Excellent, Good, Average, Poor
Survey Score: float between 0.0 and 10.0
Exactly[Submit Request] | |
Existence[Review Request] | |
Chain Precedence[Review Request, Submit Request] | | |0,24,h
Exclusive Choice[Approve Request, Reject Request] | | |
Not Precedence[Reject Request, Submit Request] | | |
Precedence[Setup Remote Access, Approve Request] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Setup Remote Access, Revoke Access] | | |
Chain Succession[Setup Remote Access, Notify Employee] | | |
Alternate Response[Monitor Performance, Update Payroll] | | |0,48,h
Chain Response[Complete Survey, Send Notification] | | |0,72,h
Response[Monitor Performance, Update Payroll] | |A.Performance Rating is Excellent OR A.Performance Rating is Good OR A.Performance Rating is Average OR A.Performance Rating is Poor AND T.Payroll Status is Updated |